# Playwright storageState written by auth.setup.ts. It holds a LIVE
# better-auth.session_token, so it must never be committed. These were once
# fused onto one line (this rule and the one above, with no newline between
# them), which matched nothing at all and left a session credential tracked in
# git. Keep them as separate lines.
src/test/e2e/.auth/